    {
      "id": "sec_s1l18_r3",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Upar di gayi misaalon mein pehle column ke teen alfaaz (الْـ) ke baghair hain. Agle column mein unhi alfaaz ke shuru mein (لَـ) laga hua hai. Kisi lafz ke shuru mein (لَـ) lagaane se us mein 'yaqeenan', 'beshak' ya 'bila-shuba' ke ma'ani paida ho jaate hain. iss tarah poore lafz ka ma'ana 'yaqeenan woh ek ... hai' hota hai. (لَـ) wala lafz aam taur par jumle ke aakhir mein aata hai. Aise alfaaz Qur'an-e-Kareem mein bakasrat istemal hue hain.",
        "content": "Upar di gayi misaalon mein pehle column ke teen alfaaz (الْـ) ke baghair hain. Agle column mein unhi alfaaz ke shuru mein (لَـ) laga hua hai. Kisi lafz ke shuru mein (لَـ) lagaane se us mein 'yaqeenan', 'beshak' ya 'bila-shuba' ke ma'ani paida ho jaate hain. iss tarah poore lafz ka ma'ana 'yaqeenan woh ek ... hai' hota hai. (لَـ) wala lafz aam taur par jumle ke aakhir mein aata hai. Aise alfaaz Qur'an-e-Kareem mein bakasrat istemal hue hain.",
        "hinglish_text": "Upar di gayi misaalon mein pehle column ke teen alfaaz (الْـ) ke baghair hain. Agle column mein unhi alfaaz ke shuru mein (لَـ) laga hua hai. Kisi lafz ke shuru mein (لَـ) lagaane se us mein 'yaqeenan', 'beshak' ya 'bila-shuba' ke ma'ani paida ho jaate hain. iss tarah poore lafz ka ma'ana 'yaqeenan woh ek ... hai' hota hai. (لَـ) wala lafz aam taur par jumle ke aakhir mein aata hai. Aise alfaaz Qur'an-e-Kareem mein bakasrat istemal hue hain."
      }
    },
