    {
      "id": "sec_s1l18_r6",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Ta'keed ka (لَـ) baaz auqaat un alfaaz ke shuru mein bhi aata hai jo (الْـ) se shuru hote hain. Aisi soorat mein (الْـ) ka alif gir jaata hai aur dono laam aapas mein mil jaate hain (jaise الْـ + لَـ = لَلْـ) aur tarjuma mein 'yaqeenan' ka izafa hota hai. Darj zail Qur'ani jumlon ko samjhein aur tarjuma karein:",
        "content": "Ta'keed ka (لَـ) baaz auqaat un alfaaz ke shuru mein bhi aata hai jo (الْـ) se shuru hote hain. Aisi soorat mein (الْـ) ka alif gir jaata hai aur dono laam aapas mein mil jaate hain (jaise الْـ + لَـ = لَلْـ) aur tarjuma mein 'yaqeenan' ka izafa hota hai. Darj zail Qur'ani jumlon ko samjhein aur tarjuma karein:",
        "hinglish_text": "Ta'keed ka (لَـ) baaz auqaat un alfaaz ke shuru mein bhi aata hai jo (الْـ) se shuru hote hain. Aisi soorat mein (الْـ) ka alif gir jaata hai aur dono laam aapas mein mil jaate hain (jaise الْـ + لَـ = لَلْـ) aur tarjuma mein 'yaqeenan' ka izafa hota hai. Darj zail Qur'ani jumlon ko samjhein aur tarjuma karein:"
