    {
      "id": "sec_s1l18_r8",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Yeh ta'keed ka (لَـ) Qur'an-e-Majeed mein mukhtalif alfaaz ke saath kasrat se istemal hota hai aur iss se kalaam mein shadeed ta'keed (zor) paida hota hai. Aane wale sabaqon mein tarjuma karte waqt iss baat ko achhi tarah zehen mein rakhein.",
        "content": "Yeh ta'keed ka (لَـ) Qur'an-e-Majeed mein mukhtalif alfaaz ke saath kasrat se istemal hota hai aur iss se kalaam mein shadeed ta'keed (zor) paida hota hai. Aane wale sabaqon mein tarjuma karte waqt iss baat ko achhi tarah zehen mein rakhein.",
        "hinglish_text": "Yeh ta'keed ka (لَـ) Qur'an-e-Majeed mein mukhtalif alfaaz ke saath kasrat se istemal hota hai aur iss se kalaam mein shadeed ta'keed (zor) paida hota hai. Aane wale sabaqon mein tarjuma karte waqt iss baat ko achhi tarah zehen mein rakhein."
