      "type": "grace_box",
      "data": {
        "text": "Agar aap Qur'an-e-Pak ko nahin samajhte, toh iski zimmedari kisi doosre fard, giroh ya qaum par nahin balki khud aap par aaid hoti hai, aur aakhirat mein iski baaz-purs (hisaab) khud aap hi se hogi."
